            "Summersweet Cottage by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Summersweet Cottage is in the Watercolor Crossing II District, within a mile of the Dragonfly Pool, the closest grocery store, and many dining options. Take advantage of the complimentary 6-seater golf cart and 3 bikes!<br> <br>Highlights:<br>📍WaterColor Crossing II District!<br>🏖️Private WaterColor Beach Access<br>👣 400 steps to Dragonfly Pool, near Camp Watercolor, private beach club, etc<br>🛺 Six-seater golf cart!<br>🚿 Outdoor shower<br>🕶️ Explore Seaside, WaterColor, Seagrove, Alys and Rosemary Beach<br>🚲 3 bikes!<br>🦞 4-star restaurants<br>🛍️ Cute boutiques<br> <br>Inside, the spacious living room will accommodate your entire crew, perfect for movie nights after a long day at the beach. Beyond the gourmet kitchen, the dining area has a delightful dining table with six seats.<br><br>On the 2nd floor, a spacious primary bedroom, king, has a private bath with a double vanity and walk-in shower. The guest room, king, has a full private bath, and the lovely bunk room, featuring twin over twin bunk beds and a shared hall bath.<br><br>At Summersweet Cottage, the warmth of hospitality awaits. Our dedicated team at Oversee, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br>- .6 miles to the beach (Scenic 395 Access)<br>- 400 steps to Dragonfly Pool<br>- 3 bedrooms, 3.5 bath<br>- 2030 sq ft<br>- Access to WaterColor community pools and beach club (9 wristbands included)<br>- Outdoor shower<br>- Limited onsite parking, minimal community parking with pass<br>- 6-seater golf cart included<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- 3 bikes included<br><br>Overnight:<br>- King in 2nd floor primary bedroom; private bath; TV<br>- 